<title>USA: Vision-Sciences says Q4 revenues rose.</title>
<headline>Vision-Sciences says Q4 revenues rose.</headline>
<dateline>NATICK, Mass. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vision-Sciences Inc said Wednesday net sales for its fourth quarter, ended March 31, 1997 were $2.1 million, up 18 percent from $1.8 million for the same period last year.</p>
<p>Net sales for the year end were $8.3 million, compared with $6.2 million for the prior fiscal year, a 33 percent increase.</p>
<p>Final results for the quarter and year end are expected in May after the completion of its audit, Vision-Sciences said.</p>
</text>
